{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_063B40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你啊，怎么说呢，相当奔放……或者说很开放、很不受拘束……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"哎呀。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"总之，看起来是个很自由的女人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"Freedom！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":10,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"是吗？巴黎的女人都这样啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"都这样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对啊，怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"怎么说呢……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"从五月革命以后就是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"五月革命……是那场把总统逼到辞职的总罢工吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"对，1968年的。不过那不只是一场罢工。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"说到底，它起源于1966年斯特拉斯堡大学的学生运动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"而且他们并不是向国家提出什么要求，只是要求校内改革。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"但这点燃了当时那些对社会不满的年轻人的心火，运动随之蔓延到整个法国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"人们反对越南战争、反对当时的戴高乐政权，还高喊自由恋爱、摆脱旧有价值观。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"现在回头看，我也不知道当时最核心的目标到底是什么……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"总之，五月革命并不只是总罢工或政权更替，而是一场年轻人的运动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"我不太懂……类似嬉皮士运动吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"也许有相似之处。不过我们没有沉溺于神秘主义，也不追求回归自然。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"原来如此。嬉皮士想建立一个封闭的、只属于自己的<R=世界,COMMUNE>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=世界,COMMUNE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"而我们试图改变这个世界，也明白了只要大家齐心协力，世界就能被改变。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"……听起来像做梦。在美国，嬉皮士现在已经只是社会问题了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"听说Kaz待过的日本，学生运动最后也失败了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"到底有什么不同呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"谁知道。我自己也想知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""}]}